<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-044" chapter-id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu" source-id="s-jinshu-044-zhengqiu">
  <p id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0000" ref="x18_cng_88g_A">球</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0002" ref="x18_cng_88g_A">子瑜</persName>。少辟宰府，入侍二宮。<persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0015" ref="e81_f09_000">成都王</persName>為大將軍，起義討<persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0026" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG">趙王倫</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0030" ref="x18_cng_88g_A">球</persName>自頓丘太守為右長史，以功封平壽公。累遷侍中、尚書、散騎常侍、中護軍、尚書右僕射，領吏部。永嘉二年卒，追贈金紫光祿大夫，諡曰元。<persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0094" ref="x18_cng_88g_A">球</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-044-zhengqiu:line033:m0096" ref="x18_cng_88g_B">豫</persName>，永嘉末為尚書。</p>
</text>
